<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>崔珠源 - 运营/策划</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
            background: #fff;
            color: #333;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        header {
            background: #f9f9f9;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;
            padding: 20px 0;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;
        }

        nav {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #000;
        }

        nav a {
            margin-left: 30px;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #666;
            transition: color 0.3s;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: #000;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }

        .hero {
            padding: 80px 0;
            text-align: center;}

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 48px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 18px;
            color: #999;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .cta-button {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 12px 30px;
            background: #000;
            color: #fff;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 4px;
            transition: background 0.3s;
        }

        .cta-button:hover {
            background: #333;
        }

        section {
            padding: 60px 0;
            border-top: 1px solid #eee;
        }

        section h2 {
            font-size: 32px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .resume {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;}

        .resume-item {
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .resume-item h3 {
            font-size: 18px;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .resume-item .time {
            color: #999;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .resume-item p {
            color: #666;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .works {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 30px;
        }

        .work-card {
            background: #f9f9f9;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
        }

        .work-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }

        .work-card h3 {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-size: 18px;
        }

        .work-card .tag {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #e8e8e8;
            padding: 4px 10px;
            border-radius: 3px;
            font-size: 12px;
            margin-right: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;color: #666;
        }

        .work-card p {
            color: #666;
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .contact {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 60px 0;
        }

        .contact p {
            font-size: 18px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;}

        .contact-links {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 30px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .contact-links a {
            color: #000;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: color 0.3s;
        }

        .contact-links a:hover {
            color: #999;
        }

        footer {
            background: #f9f9f9;
            border-top: 1px solid #eee;
            padding: 30px 0;
            text-align: center;
            color: #999;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            nav {
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 15px;
            }

            nav a {
                margin-left: 0;
            }

            .hero h1 {
                font-size: 32px;
            }

            .hero p {
                font-size: 16px;
            }

            section h2 {
                font-size: 24px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <nav class="container">
            <div class="logo">CZY</div>
            <div>
                <a href="#about">关于</a>
                <a href="#resume">简历</a>
                <a href="#works">作品</a>
                <a href="#contact">联系</a>
            </div>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <section class="hero" id="about">
        <div class="container">
            <h1>崔珠源</h1>
            <p>运营策划 | 项目管理</p>
            <a href="#contact" class="cta-button">联系我</a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="resume">
        <div class="container">
            <h2>简历</h2>
            <div class="resume">
                <div class="resume-item">
                    <h3>工作经历</h3>
                    <div class="time">2024 - 至今</div>
                    <p>运营策划专家，负责项目规划、执行和管理。具有丰富的跨部门协作经验，擅长数据分析和战略制定。</p>
                </div>

                <div class="resume-item">
                    <h3>核心能力</h3>
                    <p>项目管理 · 市场策划 · 数据分析 · 团队协作 · 内容策划 · 用户运营 · 活动策划</p>
                </div>

                <div class="resume-item">
                    <h3>教育背景</h3>
                    <div class="time">本科</div>
                    <p>相关专业毕业，具备扎实的专业基础。</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="works">
        <div class="container">
            <h2>代表作品</h2>
            <div class="works">
                <div class="work-card">
                    <h3>产品上线运营计划</h3>
                    <span class="tag">项目管理</span>
                    <span class="tag">运营策划</span>
                    <p>从0-1制定产品上线运营策略，包括用户获取、转化优化和留存方案，成功实现用户增长目标。</p>
                </div>

                <div class="work-card">
                    <h3>用户活动策划执行</h3>
                    <span class="tag">活动策划</span>
                    <span class="tag">数据分析</span>
                    <p>策划并执行系列用户活动，通过数据驱动优化活动形式，提升参与度和转化率。</p>
                </div>

                <div class="work-card">
                    <h3>内容运营体系建设</h3>
                    <span class="tag">内容策划</span>
                    <span class="tag">运营系统</span>
                    <p>建立完整的内容运营体系，制定内容标准和发布计划，提升品牌影响力。</p>
                </div>

                <div class="work-card">
                    <h3>市场分析报告</h3>
                    <span class="tag">市场研究</span>
                    <span class="tag">数据分析</span>
                    <p>深入市场调研，产出详细分析报告，为战略决策提供数据支撑。</p>
                </div>

                <div class="work-card">
                    <h3>跨部门项目协调</h3>
                    <span class="tag">项目管理</span>
                    <span class="tag">团队协作</span>
                    <p>协调多个部门资源，推进大型项目落地，确保项目按时高质量完成。</p>
                </div>

                <div class="work-card">
                    <h3>商业合作方案</h3>
                    <span class="tag">战略合作</span>
                    <span class="tag">商业谈判</span>
                    <p>负责商业合作谈判和方案设计，拓展新的商业增长点。</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="contact" class="contact">
        <div class="container">
            <h2>联系方式</h2>
            <p>欢迎咨询或合作</p>
            <div class="contact-links">
                <a href="mailto:your-email@example.com">📧 邮箱</a>
                <a href="tel:+8613800000000">📱 电话</a>
                <a href="https://linkedin.com" target="_blank">💼 LinkedIn</a>
                <a href="https://wechat.com" target="_blank">💬 微信</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <div class="container">
            <p>&copy; 2024 崔珠源. 保留所有权利。</p>
        </div>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
